# November 18, 2026: the Little Red River hill country of Arkansas: Cleburne County (Heber Springs, Quitman, Woodrow,
# Brewer, Ida, Edgemont), with Van Buren County (Clinton, Shirley, Damascus) and Stone County (Mountain View, Allison,
# Blanchard Springs) beside it. Region drawn at random by tools/choose.py (ar); the county by a random draw.
# Sources read in this session: the National Register nomination forms (NPGallery "_text" PDFs, text layers read with
